note right of services::support_console
Key: UML 2.5.1 package diagram.
Folder: a Python package (a folder) or
module (a file). A folder inside a folder
is a package inside a package: http in
infra is infra::http, the file infra/http.py.
services::reporting is services/reporting/,
the Warehouse ETL.
Dashed arrow: the package at its tail
imports from the package at its head,
so it cannot load without it.
end note
note right of services::notifications
Each arrow stands for import lines.
services::loyalty to infra::broker:
services/loyalty/points.py:3
infra::broker to infra::http:
infra/broker.py:11
end note
